diff --git a/CONTEXT.md b/CONTEXT.md
index 849a28ce5f64e781fa53346bcce7e87c61d3a20b..c1479a10e8c0dba5041a16d9e83563aff740d312 100644
--- a/CONTEXT.md
+++ b/CONTEXT.md
@@ -56,6 +56,22 @@ _Avoid_: Weekly or Monthly as Chat, one-off routing branches
 The ordered list of suspended business goals when a user switches domains. The current goal is handled first. Prior goals are resumable context only and cannot authorize a write in another domain.
 _Avoid_: One global stale goal, implicit cross-domain write permission
 
+**Message Turn**:
+One independently identified inbound user message. A Message Turn is not a conversation session and cannot inherit authority merely because it uses the same transport conversation ID.
+_Avoid_: Session, thread, business task
+
+**Natural Conversation Session**:
+A bounded period of short-term dialogue inside a longer-lived transport conversation. Its active Goal Stack, conversational entities, recent context, and Pending values may influence cognition only while the session is active. Archiving a session removes that short-term context from the active model view without deleting business facts or audit evidence.
+_Avoid_: DingTalk conversation ID, message turn, business record, permanent memory
+
+**Authoritative Business State**:
+Durable PostgreSQL Cases, reports, tasks, receipts, and other domain records whose lifecycle is governed by business rules. Ending a Natural Conversation Session never deletes or expires this state.
+_Avoid_: Chat memory, recent context, model recollection
+
+**Conversation Archive**:
+Immutable cold evidence for ended Natural Conversation Sessions and revoked Pending values. It is retained for audit and replay, is absent from semantic interpretation, and can never authorize a continuation. The active conversation-state JSON contains only a bounded recent window; complete older snapshots remain in the cold archive.
+_Avoid_: Active memory, automatic resume source, deleted history
+
 **Operation Outcome**:
 The authoritative, receipt-backed account of what one requested business operation actually changed, exposed for state progression, audit, replay, and user reply composition.
 _Avoid_: Reply text, executor message, model judgement
